# ============================================================
#  NYXUS Daily Driver — wallpaper rotation set (URBAN NEON ONLY)
#  ~/.config/nyxus/wall-rotation.list
#
#  Staged over skel only when the bake runs with NYX_EDITION=daily. The
#  shared/alien rotation list is a separate file and is never touched.
#
#  Scope rule, same discipline as the alien list: this rotation is the
#  urban-neon art direction ONLY — dark cyberpunk city/alley at night,
#  teal + amber signage. No alien murals, no graffiti-space pop-art, no
#  hacker-mode art (that is reserved for actual hacker mode), no brand or
#  kageryu plates. A wall that does not read as the approved look does not
#  belong here, because rotation is the thing the owner stares at all day.
#
#  One slug per line; resolves in ~/.config/hypr/walls[/rotation] or
#  /usr/share/backgrounds/nyxus. Comment a line to drop it.
#  Every slug here must also exist in the backgrounds manifest.tsv.
# ============================================================

# -- approved urban-neon set (2026-08-01) --
nyxus-urban-flower-wall
nyxus-urban-flower-concrete
nyxus-urban-astronaut-moonwalk
nyxus-hero-cosmic
